 "words": 182,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "King Belshazzar threw a party for a thousand of his lords",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They drank the wine from the temple cups and laughed at the holy things",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They praised the gods of silver and the gods of gold and stone",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a hand came out of nowhere and the laughter died alone",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The fingers wrote upon the plaster by the lampstand's light",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The king's face turned to ashes and his knees knocked in the night",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No wise man in the city could read the words or tell",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they called for the old exile, Daniel, who knew God well",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "MENE, MENE, TEKEL, and PARSIN",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You have been weighed on the scales",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And found too light",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Weighed on the scales and found too light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God has numbered the days of your kingdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And brought it to an end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your kingdom has been divided",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And given to the Medes and Persians",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "MENE, MENE, TEKEL, and PARSIN",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You have been weighed on the scales",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And found too light",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Weighed on the scales and found too light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That very night the king was slain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Weighed on the scales",
